--TEST--
an interface's body is the declaration's own node the way a class's is, so a cursor between its members expands to the whole thing, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Greets
{
    <|>
    public function greet(): string;
}
--REQUEST--
selectionRange
--EXPECT--
2:1-6:2
